  {
    "RowId": 37000,
    "Text": "Defeat Themis"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 37001,
    "Text": "My heart quivers in anticipation!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 37002,
    "Text": "Now to take your measure..."
  },
  {
    "RowId": 37003,
    "Text": "Will Light embrace, or Darkness consume?"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 37004,
    "Text": "I learned this technique from a dear friend!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 37005,
    "Text": "The balance must needs be maintained..."
  },
  {
    "RowId": 37006,
    "Text": "Submit to the emissary's judgment!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 37007,
    "Text": "These magicks are not for you to wield!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 37008,
    "Text": "Emet-Selch himself could do no better!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 37009,
    "Text": "Warriors forged in my own image!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 37010,
    "Text": "I must fashion more robust champions..."
  },
  {
    "RowId": 37011,
    "Text": "How transcendent, the flames of battle!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 37012,
    "Text": "I am the emissary, and I shall never die!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 37013,
    "Text": "Will you be judged worthy to exist?"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 37014,
    "Text": "Long have I dreamed of the day that we match wits..."
  },
  {
    "RowId": 37015,
    "Text": "But every dream must come to an end!"
  },
